    "long_instructions": "## **Investigate**\r\n\r\nRun the code again and look at the output.\r\n\r\n**Trace it:** Before line 2 runs, `grade` doesn't exist yet. After line 2 runs, what value does `grade` store? Finish the comment on line 2 with your answer.\r\n\r\n**Tinker:** Add a new line after line 2: `grade = grade + 1`. Run the code again. What changed in the output? Why did it change?\r\n\r\n**Comment it:** Finish the comment on line 4, explaining what `input()` does in this line.",
